From 118d076cb9222517acaec6318020ead87dcbc193 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ShiftPro Release Bot <release-bot@shiftpro.local>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:53:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] release: prepare ShiftPro for Google Play production

AUDIT & TESTS
- Fix Jest test failure: align computeSalaryForRange helper with the
  2-decimal (cents) rounding convention used by js/salary.js (was integer
  Math.round, test expected 346.15). All 33 tests now pass.

OFFLINE + SECURITY
- Vendor 4 third-party JS libs (xlsx, chart.js, jspdf, html2canvas) into
  vendor/ and remove all cdn.jsdelivr.net fallback URLs from
  js/backup.js, js/charts.js, js/pdf-export.js, js/reports.js. The app
  is now fully offline and no longer loads remote code into the WebView
  that handles sensitive employee data.
- Add vendor/README.md documenting versions, upstreams, licenses and
  the verification procedure.

ANDROID PROJECT (Capacitor)
- Generate Android project via 'npx cap add android' (Capacitor 8).
- app/build.gradle: versionCode 1, versionName '2.5.0' (matches web
  app version); release signing config loaded from SIGNING_STORE_*
  environment variables (populated from GitHub Secrets in CI); debug
  build type explicitly sets debuggable true; release explicitly
  debuggable false + jniDebuggable false + renderscriptDebuggable false.
- AndroidManifest.xml: allowBackup=false, fullBackupContent=false,
  dataExtractionRules excludes all domains (employee data never leaves
  the device via cloud backup or device transfer); usesCleartextTraffic=
  false; networkSecurityConfig enforces HTTPS only.
- MainActivity.java: explicitly disable WebView debugging in release
  builds (defense-in-depth on top of Capacitor's default).
- styles.xml + colors.xml: status bar #1E2A44, navigation bar #121A2E,
  windowLayoutInDisplayCutoutMode=shortEdges for edge-to-edge.
- network_security_config.xml + data_extraction_rules.xml added.

ANDROID BACK BUTTON
- Install @capacitor/app@^8.1.2 (official Capacitor plugin).
- js/app.js: backButton listener closes any open sheet/modal first,
  then falls through to default Capacitor behavior (history back /
  exit app). Matches Android UX expectations.

LAUNCHER ICONS
- Generate all density legacy (square + round) + adaptive foreground
  icons from existing icon-512.png. Adaptive background = #1E2A44.
- Generate Play Store feature graphic 1024x500 (assets/play-feature-
  graphic.png).

PRIVACY POLICY LINKAGE
- index.html: add 'View privacy policy' button in About sheet.
- locales/en.js, locales/ar.js: add 'about.view_privacy_policy' string.
- index.html: bump hardcoded '2.0.0' version to '2.5.0'.
- privacy-policy.html: add Android-specific paragraph to section 3
  (on-device WebView storage, no cloud backup, uninstall = delete).

CI/CD WORKFLOW
- Rewrite .github/workflows/android-build.yml as a 2-job pipeline:
  Job 1 (test-and-prepare): npm ci, run Jest tests, prepare:web,
  verify presence of 14 critical assets, upload www artifact.
  Job 2 (android-build): install Android SDK 36 + build-tools 36.0.0,
  npm ci, prepare:web, validate capacitor.config.json, cap sync
  android, build debug APK, decode signing keystore from secrets
  (if configured), build release AAB, verify signature with
  jarsigner, upload both APK + AAB artifacts with retention.
- Workflow gracefully degrades to an unsigned release AAB when
  signing secrets are absent (clearly labeled as such).

SIGNING HELPER
- scripts/generate-upload-keystore.sh: one-shot script to generate
  the Play upload keystore locally and print the exact GitHub Secret
  configuration instructions.

DOCS
- docs/PLAY-STORE-LISTING.md: full store listing checklist (EN + AR),
  Data safety form answers, IARC questionnaire, target audience,
  permissions justification, screenshot capture instructions, links
  to official Google Play documentation consulted 15 Oct 2026.
- docs/RELEASE-AUDIT.md: this audit + implementation report.

CONFIG
- .gitignore: keep www/ ignored (regenerated by prepare:web); ignore
  android build outputs + local.properties + release/ debug/ dirs;
  never commit *.jks / *.keystore / *.p12 / *.pem / signing.properties.
- package.json: add @capacitor/app dependency.
